<title>EGYPT: Egypt overnight rates steady, one-week rates slip.</title>
<headline>Egypt overnight rates steady, one-week rates slip.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egyptian pound overnight interbank rates were steady on Tuesday between 10 1/4 and 10 3/8 percent in a liquid private sector market.</p>
<p>One-week rates on the pound were slightly lower at 10 1/4 and 10 3/8 percent from Monday's 10 3/8 and 10 7/16 percent.</p>
<p>Public sector banks maintained their minimum overnight lending rate at 10 1/2 percent.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +202 578 3290/91</p>
